window.products.push({"id":530087,"name":"GooQee Automatic Touchless Countertop Liquid Soap Dispenser with IR Sensor - Remain Visible Window - Waterproof Base for Kitchen Bathroom Sanitizer Sh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Lktp4ZD2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"GooQee Automatic Touchless Liquid Soap Dispenser comes with innovative infra-red sensor technology provides a sanitary, no-touch and easy-to-use operation that will only be activated when needed. Ideal for kitchen, bathroom, hospital, school, hotel, restaurant, workshop, etc., to stop spreading germs. OPERATION TIPS: 1. Clean it with water before 1st time use. Clean it each time for using different soap2. Slide switch to OFF and install batteries before filling soap3. The viscosity of the soap will affect dosing quantity. The thicker soap, the little soap comes out. If the soap is too thin, then much soap flow. You can choose right soap as per your requirement.4. The longer time you hold your hand there, the more soap is dispensed (but it will automatically cease after 4 seconds to save soap). Simply moving your hand once you get enough soap5. Please remove the batteries if long time not to use6. Do not immerse the bottom of the dispenser in water. 7. Do not expose the dispenser directly into strong sunlight which will cause automatically dispensing TROUBLESHOOTING - NOT WORKING 1. Please make sure the batteries installed correctly2. Remain less than 40ml will stop dispensing. Refill it regularly3. Low Temperature will stop dispensing. The working temperature is 3℃~40℃ (37°F-104°F)4. Nozzle blocked will stop dispensing. Clean it with water SPECIFICATION Material: Chrome + ABS plastic Capacity of dispenser: Max: 12oz (340ml), Min: 1.4oz (40ml)Capacity of dispensing: 0.14oz (4ml)Input Power: 4x1.5V AAA Battery(not included)  Dimension: 5 x 3 x 7.5inch (130 x 80 x 190mm) Item Weight: 245gCertification:CE, FCC, RoHSGuarantee: 12 months warranty Package Contents: 1 x Soap Dispenser(White), 1 x User Manual (Soap not included)Click Add to Cart now and try GooQee Automatic soap dispenser to keep your home GERM FREE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Lktp4ZD2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GooQee","source_asin":"B01GCMFLXK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-530087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GCMFLXK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GCMFLXK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":530088,"name":"Memory Foam Solutions Elastic Bed Topper, 2-Inch, Twin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21ukXxE9JRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Memory foam's ability to reduce pressure points is one of the reasons so many people are using it to get the best night's sleep. Now you can enjoy the benefits of memory foam without having to buy a new mattress by adding this memory foam mattress topper to your existing spring, latex, or even memory foam mattress. This topper will add comfort and increase the quality of sleep from your mattress immediately. Two inches of two and a half-pound density memory foam used in this topper is specifically designed to enhance the feel of your current mattress, and also provides additional support in areas where your mattress may be dipping or sagging. The foam is also specially formulated to contour to your body at any temperature, and will give you the extra comfort you need to get the best night's sleep possible from your current mattress. Environmentally friendly processes used to make our memory foam. This makes our toppers more \"green\" and eco-friendly, by the use of earth friendly processes. Our toppers have also earned the PURGreen certification, which means they are manufactured, fabricated and packaged in the U.S.A. meeting all EPA and CSPC standards being safe and free from harmful chemicals. PURGreen uses independent laboratory results to qualify products and ensure they are manufactured without the use of ozone-depleting substances such as Chlorofluorocarbans, Polybrominated Diphenyl Ether substances, Harmful Metals, Formaldehyde, Prohibited Phalates or any other unsafe materials. PURGreen also implements baseline requirements such as conserving water, energy and other natural resources in the manufacturing processes established through internationally accepted ISO standards and procedures.***There may be a new foam smell associated with your new topper; however, this odor is not toxic or harmful passing all PUrGreen, EPA and CSPC standards. MADE IN THE USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21ukXxE9JRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Memory Foam Solutions","source_asin":"B00J1UHSXC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-530088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J1UHSXC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J1UHSXC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
