window.products.push({"id":530440,"name":"Meat Thermometer | 165ft Long Range Smart Wireless Food Thermometer with Bluetooth and Assisted Cooking for BBQ, Oven, Deep Frying, etc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-RChNV69L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【TRUE and SMART WIRELESS】No wires No mess! This Oven Thermometer is able to be inserted and left in the meat for the entire cooking process. Don't mess with tangled wires, or the need to constantly open the grill just to check your temps. Perfect for outdoor cooking. With the Bluetooth, you can get your temp signals from at least 165ft even you don't have WiFi and internet. 【Charging Model】20 minutes of charging and 6 hours of use. Standby time is 7-8 hours. Never waste too much battery! This Cooking Thermometer is super easy to clean, safe to put in the dishwasher and suitable for sous-vide cooking which is ideal for low and slow cooks. Moreover, it is deep fryer safe. 【Measuring Range of Ice and Fire】This Candy Thermometer can monitor internal temperature -40°F(-40ºC) up to 212°F (100ºC) and ambient / external temperature up to 527°F(300°C) simultaneously. As the internal shaft is inserted into the meat, it will never exceed 212ºF unless you’re cooking charcoal! 【Guided Cook System】Walks you through every step of the cooking process to guarantee perfect and consistent results.Can estimate how long to cook and rest your food to help plan your meal and manage your time. Built-in timers and alerts. We'll tell you when to flip your food, adjust the heat, and how long to let it rest. 【30 DAY SATISFACTION GUARANTEED】Give it a try, if you don't like it feel free to return it at no cost to you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-RChNV69L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEITASI","source_asin":"B097C79N7M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-530440","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097C79N7M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097C79N7M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":530441,"name":"Duck River Textiles - Home Decorator Window Curtain Pair Panel Drapes for Living room, Bedroom, Kids Room, Children, Nursery - Set of 2 Panels - 40 X ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fF4R7gYTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Bringing style and boldness to your room, Arcadia is a timeless piece. With its semi sheer fabric and trendy printed patter it is sure to spark conversation at your next party. From the Manufacturer Duck River Textile, Inc. was founded twenty years ago by the Cohen Brothers; Oury, Eili, Raymond, and Joseph. They started out in a 30,000 square foot factory, buying fabrics from the U.S. Mills, producing Sheets, window and Shower Curtains. They have a 75 year family history in Textiles, going back to their Grandfather, who had his own Spinning and Weaving Mill overseas. He taught his grandsons all about Fabrics and Techniques which they still use until today. Fifteen years ago, as the U.S. Mills started shutting down one by one. The Cohen Brothers were one of the first who had the foresight to move their factory overseas. They created partnerships and joint ventures in China, which still exist today. They continue to reinvest and capitalize their partnerships, giving them and their factories a leading edge in the market place, with new Production capabilities, Machinery, Innovative Techniques, and Fashion Design. Duck River has been praised and recognized by many in the industry for their foresight, on time deliveries, and Fashion Forward thinking. Today our Private Label business and Direct POE orders account for 40 percent of our growing business.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fF4R7gYTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duck River Textiles","source_asin":"B00KVEEAZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-530441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KVEEAZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KVEEAZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
