window.products.push({"id":530615,"name":"Cookie Cutter by 3DForme, LOL DOLL Serias Baking Cake Fondant Frame Mold for Buscuit, Set 2 Piece (Doll 5)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fXHz3MJcL._AC_.jpg","description":"Introducing our eco-friendly Cookie Cutters made of PLA, a material that is both safe for the environment and for your family. These cutters are designed with additional bands to prevent bending, ensuring they retain their shape and do not rust like metal cutters. They are also easy to use, with a bright and fun appearance that makes baking with them an enjoyable experience for all. Our Cookie Cutters are safe for children to use, with no small parts or sharp corners that could harm them. The cutters are perfect for making gingerbread cookies and can be used to create fun and colorful treats with your kids. The long-term durability of these cutters is guaranteed, as long as they are used as intended and not put under excessive strain. In addition to being easy to use, our Cookie Cutters are also easy to clean. Simply wash them with warm water and soap, and they will be ready for your next baking adventure. And if you're looking for a unique and personalized touch to your treats, our logo cookie cutter is perfect for making cookies with your favorite brand's emblem. Make baking a fun and enjoyable activity for the whole family with our cookie cutters, which come in the form of heroes from popular animated shows. With our cutters, you can make delicious and colorful treats that will delight your loved ones. Please Note!!! that our Cookie Cutters should not be washed in a dishwasher, cooked or baked with, or exposed to boiling water. They are sensitive to high temperatures and may lose their shape when exposed to temperatures above 113°F (40°C).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fXHz3MJcL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"3DForme","source_asin":"B07ZRQW27L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-530615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZRQW27L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZRQW27L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":530616,"name":"FUELSHAKER Ice Series Shaker Bottle with Fueler. 2016 Model (Ice Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515dvO7VN2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"NEW & IMPROVED 2016 FUELSHAKER - featuring an innovative Fueler powder cartridge and hassle-free push-button mixing system.^LEAK PROOF TECHNOLOGY - all Fuelshaker seals are designed with leak-proof technology. Once you screw the lid on the shaker cup you dont have to worry about the liquid inside leaking. Put it in your bag and use it whenever you are ready!^TURBINE SHAPED AGITATOR - the perfect mixing mechanism! Once it is released into the cup along with your supplement powder its turbine-shaped edges cut through even the toughest of powders! With just the press of the button located at the bottom of the container the agitator is released into the cup and your supplement powders are now free to mix. Its that easy!^DISHWASHER SAFE - Fuelshaker is designed with the convenience of dishwasher use in mind. It is top-rack dishwasher safe meaning you dont have to worry about washing by hand! Made out of high-quality PP material (100% BPA-Free!) it will withstand a life-time of runs through the dishwasher. With the open bottom end you will have a clean cup after every run through the dishwasher!^MIX & MATCH FUELERS - Fuelshaker Fuelers are an easy solution: after using your first Fueler just remove and swap in your new pre-packed Fueler then add water. Hydrate and Mix when youre ready!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515dvO7VN2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fuelshaker","source_asin":"B017KX1BRA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-530616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017KX1BRA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017KX1BRA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
