window.products.push({"id":530779,"name":"MIOZON 72x 32 LED Bathroom Mirror with Front and Backlight, Large Dimmable Wall Mirrors with Anti-Fog, Shatter-Proof, Memory, 3 Colors, Double LED Van","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":534.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51201BgL8sL._AC_.jpg","description":"Tempered Glass 【Enhanced Lighting】-The MIOZON LED lighted bathroom mirror features two built-in LED strip lights that emit double the brightness from both the back and front, providing ample lighting for makeup, shaving, and beauty care. 【Durability】- Our mirror is crafted from durable armored glass, ensuring it is highly resistant to breakage. Even if it does break, it will not shatter into sharp pieces, making it safe to use. Additionally, the mirror is coated with epoxy for corrosion resistance, passing a 30-day acid test without any signs of corrosion. 【Fog-Free】-The LED vanity mirror is equipped with a defog film on the back, preventing fog from forming and ensuring a clear image even in a steamy bathroom. 【Customizable Illumination】-Achieve your preferred lighting setup with the MIOZON LED illuminated mirror. Its touch button enables you to easily switch between warm, natural, and white color temperatures, as well as adjust brightness levels to your liking. It also has an intelligent memory function that records your preferred lighting settings, restoring them when you turn the mirror on and off. 【Easy Installation】-Installing the MIOZON LED mirror is a piece of cake - it has two mounting options available, plug-in or hardwired installation, whichever you prefer. However, we suggest seeking professional assistance if you opt for hardwiring. 【Commitment to Customer Service & Warranty】-MIOZON is deeply devoted to delivering excellent customer service. We offer a three-year warranty on all our LED lighted mirrors and welcome all recommendations for how we can improve our products to be the best they can be. Tips: To turn off the blue lights on the controls, simply long-press the button until they turn off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51201BgL8sL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIOZON","source_asin":"B0B4ZXS354","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-530779","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4ZXS354","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4ZXS354","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
